  "scope": "Initial finite guard alphabets advance through every actual checked native instruction. Pure initial class schedules construct full current Scans at actual returned heaps, derive the older reached range interfaces, and retain full Frame, numeric Fits, finite guard carrier, effects, original values, fourth-memo validity and Extends, and the same worker result at every independently larger choice of five fuels. The caller constructs strict logical source reads, complete same-inventory Post, exact outer tables and Merge, original selected order and multiplicity, and sound stopped-class refutation. Initial assumptions remain Frame, Fits, valid memos, proper paths, active classes for refutation, and pure initial query reservations. No future graph, reached ranges, worker success, finite input Cap or whole-forest closedness is a producer premise. AnswerSound remains one-sided. These are logical, partly noncomputable bounds, not extracted Haskell budgets or host capacity. Remaining Required cap support, complete source control flow and outer descent, arbitrary recursive callers, convergence, current adapters, lazy Haskell forcing, runtime and whole public Haskell correspondence remain open."
